<Layout title="Banda Bruna | Orquesta Oficial - Música en Vivo para Eventos y Festivales" description="Sitio oficial de Banda Bruna. Cumbia sureña y cumbia chilena en vivo para festivales municipales, bodas y eventos corporativos.">
  <link rel="preload" href="/assets/images/hero/hero_1.webp" as="image" fetchpriority="high" slot="head" />
  
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href={heroImages[0]} fetchpriority="high" slot="head" />
  
  <!-- ====================================================================== -->
  <!-- BLOQUE 01. IMPACTO: HERO ESCÉNICO DOMINANTE                            -->
  <!-- ====================================================================== -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[90vh] lg:min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden bg-black px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 pt-28 pb-12 lg:py-0" aria-label="Portada Principal - Banda Bruna en Vivo">
    
    <!-- Background Slider/Carousel con iluminación escénica -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden">
      {heroImages.map((src, index) => (
        <div 
          class={`hero-slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-all duration-1000 ${index === 0 ? 'opacity-100 scale-100' : 'opacity-0 scale-105'}`} 
          style={`background-image: url('${src}');`}
        ></div>
      ))}
      
      <!-- Viñeta y gradiente escénico atmosférico (#040815) -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#040815] via-black/60 to-black/45 z-1"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial-gradient from-transparent via-[#040815]/50 to-[#040815] z-1 pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Controles del Slider Hero (Touch target >= 44x44px) -->
    <button id="hero-prev" class="absolute left-3 sm:left-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-white/15 hover:border-gold-bruna bg-black/50 hover:bg-black/85 text-white hover:text-gold-bruna flex items-center justify-center transition-all cursor-pointer select-none backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg" aria-label="Imagen anterior">
      <span class="text-lg">❮</span>
    </button>
    <button id="hero-next" class="absolute right-3 sm:right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px] w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-white/15 hover:border-gold-bruna bg-black/50 hover:bg-black/85 text-white hover:text-gold-bruna flex items-center justify-center transition-all cursor-pointer select-none backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg" aria-label="Imagen siguiente">
      <span class="text-lg">❯</span>
    </button>

    <!-- Contenido Central del Hero: Impacto, Título y 2 CTAs -->
    <div class="relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto w-full lg:h-full z-20 flex flex-col justify-center py-12 lg:py-24 gap-6 text-center lg:text-left">
      
      <!-- Badges superiores (Próximo show + Estreno Patrio) -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-2.5 mb-2">
        <a 
          href="/sesion-fiestas-patrias" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#030d2a] via-[#10204d] to-[#4c0b0b] border border-red-500/60 hover:border-gold-bruna text-white text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(220,38,38,0.35)] transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 group backdrop-blur-md"
        >
          <span class="text-sm">🇨🇱</span>
          <span class="bg-red-600 text-white text-[9px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider font-mono shadow-sm">ESTRENO</span>
          <span class="text-slate-100 group-hover:text-gold-bruna transition-colors font-title">Sesión Fiestas Patrias</span>
          <span class="text-gold-bruna group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform font-bold">➔</span>
        </a>

        {imminentEvent ? (
          <div 
            id="imminent-event-badge"
            data-event-date={imminentEvent.fecha}
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-gold-bruna/70 text-gold-bruna text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(214,175,55,0.3)] animate-pulse"
          >
            <span>✨</span>
            <span>PRÓXIMO SHOW: {imminentEvent.nombre} ({imminentEvent.day} {imminentEvent.monthName} · {imminentEvent.lugar || imminentEvent.ciudad})</span>
            <span id="imminent-event-days-tag" class="bg-gold-bruna text-black text-[10px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-1 uppercase">
              {imminentEvent.diffDays === 0 ? '¡HOY!' : imminentEvent.diffDays === 1 ? '¡MAÑANA!' : `¡EN ${imminentEvent.diffDays} DÍAS!`}
            </span>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/60 border border-gold-bruna/40 text-gold-bruna text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-extrabold uppercase backdrop-blur-sm">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-bruna animate-ping"></span>
            ORQUESTA EN VIVO · CUMBIA SUREÑA PROFESIONAL
          </span>
        )}
      </div>

        <script is:inline>
          (function() {
            const badge = document.getElementById('imminent-event-badge');
            const tag = document.getElementById('imminent-event-days-tag');
            if (!badge || !tag) return;
            const eventDateStr = badge.getAttribute('data-event-date');
            if (!eventDateStr) return;

            const eventDate = new Date(eventDateStr + 'T00:00:00');
            const now = new Date();
            now.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);

            const diffTime = eventDate.getTime() - now.getTime();
            const diffDays = Math.round(diffTime / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));

            if (diffDays < 0) {
              badge.style.display = 'none';
            } else if (diffDays === 0) {
              tag.textContent = '¡HOY!';
            } else if (diffDays === 1) {
              tag.textContent = '¡MAÑANA!';
            } else {
              tag.textContent = `¡EN ${diffDays} DÍAS!`;
            }
          })();
        </script>
      </div>

      <!-- Titular Display en Cabinet Grotesk -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] text-white uppercase font-title max-w-4xl drop-shadow-md">
        MÚSICA EN VIVO PARA <span class="text-gold-bruna">FESTIVALES, MUNICIPALIDADES</span> Y GRANDES CELEBRACIONES
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtítulo en Plus Jakarta Sans -->
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-slate-200 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-2xl drop-shadow">
        Músicos con más de 15 años de trayectoria musical llevando la fuerza, el ritmo y el sonido de la cumbia sureña en directo a todo Chile.
      </p>

      <!-- Máximo Dos CTAs Principales (Mínimo 48px de área táctil) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3.5 justify-center lg:justify-start items-stretch sm:items-center pt-2">
        <a 
          href="#contacto" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-bruna to-gold-bruna-hover hover:brightness-110 text-black font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase px-7 py-3.5 min-h-[48px] rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-gold-bruna/20 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          COTIZAR EVENTO
        </a>
        <a 
          href={`https://wa.me/${config.telefono_principal ? config.telefono_principal.replace(/\+/g, '').replace(/\s+/g, '') : '56990021689'}`} 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-slate-950/80 hover:bg-slate-900 border border-green-500/40 hover:border-green-400 text-green-400 hover:text-green-300 font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase px-7 py-3.5 min-h-[48px] rounded-lg backdrop-blur-md active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12c0 1.83.49 3.55 1.34 5.03L2 22l5.12-1.34A9.93 9.93 0 0 0 12 22c5.52 0 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm3.89 13.91c-.24.67-1.19 1.25-1.74 1.33-.49.07-1.12.1-3.23-.77-2.69-1.12-4.41-3.86-4.54-4.04-.13-.18-1.08-1.44-1.08-2.75 0-1.31.68-1.95.93-2.22.24-.27.53-.34.71-.34.18 0 .36 0 .51.01.17.01.39-.06.61.46.22.53.76 1.85.83 1.99.07.14.11.3.02.48-.09.18-.14.29-.27.45-.14.16-.29.35-.41.47-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.7 1.15 1.5 1.86 1.03.92 1.9 1.2 2.17 1.34.27.14.43.11.59-.07.16-.18.68-.79.86-1.06.18-.27.36-.23.6-.14.24.09 1.53.72 1.79.85.27.14.44.2.51.31.06.12.06.69-.18 1.36z"/></svg>
          WHATSAPP OFICIAL
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Indicador de desplazamiento sutil -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20 text-slate-400 text-sm font-semibold flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-70 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">CONOCE EL SHOW</span>
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce text-gold-bruna" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====================================================================== -->
  <!-- FRANJA DE MÉTRICAS Y COMUNIDAD EN REDES SOCIALES (EN TIEMPO REAL)       -->
  <!-- ====================================================================== -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-slate-950 to-[#040815] border-y border-white/10 py-10 px-6" aria-label="Estadísticas y Comunidad de Banda Bruna">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-6 lg:gap-4 items-center justify-center text-center">
        
        <!-- 1. Trayectoria -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group/stat">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-gold-bruna/30 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-bruna mb-2 shadow-md shadow-gold-bruna/5 group-hover/stat:border-gold-bruna transition-all">
            <span class="text-base">⏳</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-title text-white block mb-0.5" data-count-target={stats.musiciansTrajectory} data-count-prefix="+">
            +{stats.musiciansTrajectory}
          </span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block leading-snug">
            Trayectoria de los Músicos
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Escenarios -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group/stat">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-gold-bruna/30 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-bruna mb-2 shadow-md shadow-gold-bruna/5 group-hover/stat:border-gold-bruna transition-all">
            <span class="text-base">✨</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-title text-white block mb-0.5" data-count-target={stats.stageYears} data-count-prefix="+">
            +{stats.stageYears}
          </span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block leading-snug">
            Años en Escenarios
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Instagram -->
        <a href={config.instagram || "https://www.instagram.com/banda_bruna/"} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex flex-col items-center group/stat transition-all hover:scale-105 duration-300">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 mb-2 shadow-md group-hover/stat:border-pink-400 group-hover/stat:bg-pink-500/20 transition-all">
